    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The integration of AI into everyday life has already begun, including attempts to replace humans in advanced workflows. You are a robot secretary, and everyone is watching to see if you can do the job better than a human. Your task is to carry out assignments while avoiding mistakes that could jeopardize the future of all robots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/extras/5c6f81ee61034866634fca6ef96a6b29.avif?t=1745963338\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to do in the office?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Office routine:</strong> Watering plants, documents for signing, letters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss maintenance:</strong> Coffee, meetings, phone calls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PC work:</strong> Sorting, investments, editing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/extras/b27e59b1035ebc94cf3f115c02ff9526.avif?t=1745963338\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strict office rules</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonuses </strong>for flawless work and<strong> penalties </strong>for mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Termination </strong>if failures exceed a critical threshold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each day brings more tasks </strong>\u2014 can you handle the pressure?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/extras/af140fee053e017cc328844b3e0ec55f.avif?t=1745963338\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Surviving after work</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expenses:</strong> Pay for your charging dock, electricity, internet, training, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades:</strong> Improve speed, battery life, remote control, or change your design.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The integration of AI into everyday life has already begun, including attempts to replace humans in advanced workflows. You are a robot secretary, and everyone is watching to see if you can do the job better than a human. Your task is to carry out assignments while avoiding mistakes that could jeopardize the future of all robots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/extras/5c6f81ee61034866634fca6ef96a6b29.avif?t=1745963338\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to do in the office?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Office routine:</strong> Watering plants, documents for signing, letters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss maintenance:</strong> Coffee, meetings, phone calls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PC work:</strong> Sorting, investments, editing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/extras/b27e59b1035ebc94cf3f115c02ff9526.avif?t=1745963338\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strict office rules</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonuses </strong>for flawless work and<strong> penalties </strong>for mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Termination </strong>if failures exceed a critical threshold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each day brings more tasks </strong>\u2014 can you handle the pressure?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/extras/af140fee053e017cc328844b3e0ec55f.avif?t=1745963338\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Surviving after work</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expenses:</strong> Pay for your charging dock, electricity, internet, training, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades:</strong> Improve speed, battery life, remote control, or change your design.</p></li></ul>",
